        <item>
            <title>3.21.2</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 22:09:13 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>215</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.21.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- When a Canopy update and an extension update both wait, the update popover no longer shows a second restart button. Restarting the session service moves open panes to the new extension too, so one restart covers both.

### Bug Fixes
- The Restart now confirmation also names sessions that are working, asking or running a background task at that moment. Its list could be up to a minute old, so a turn that had just started was stopped without being named.
]]></description>
